  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Rev 1000 TOBACCO TAX\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 78:6\n\nREVISION NOTE #1:\n\nDocument #13049, effective 6-4-20, adopted, amended, repealed, and readopted with amendments various rules in Chapter Rev 1000. This required some renumbering of rules in Part Rev 1001 as noted in the source notes. Source notes for the new, adopted rules indicate only one Document number as “#13049”. Source notes for amended rules indicate “amd by #13049”. Source notes for the rules readopted with amendments indicate “ss by #13049”.\n\nThe rules repealed by Document #13049 include the following rules:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1000.html"
